A patch on upstream Mermaid at the pin, for the reference ferrigura is checked against
(docs-port/ORACLE-PLAN.md). Applied in the order of the file names by tools/reference/setup.sh.

fix(wardley): apply the wardley-beta config section

The wardley diagram type keeps its config under `wardley-beta`, named
after its beta keyword, but nothing connected the two:

- getDiagramConfigKey('wardley') returned `wardley`, so a theme, look
  or layout set under `wardley-beta` never reached the diagram.
- The schema defaults generator skipped `wardley-beta`, so the section
  was missing from defaultConfig and configKeys, and sanitizeDirective
  stripped it from front matter and directives.

Map the type to its existing section, which keeps current configs
working, and generate its defaults. They match the renderer's
fallbacks, so rendering does not change. A new test checks that every
registered diagram type maps to a section in defaultConfig.

The fork's commit cc2425204, its changes to packages/ and .build/.

